# <%= module %>

An independent Nerves Gate SDK application. From the platform checkout:

```sh
mix app.test <%= app %> --solution PATH
mix app.package <%= app %> --solution PATH
mix app.install <%= app %> --solution PATH --device gateway_a
```

Run host unit tests directly with `mix test`. Package directly with
`MIX_ENV=prod mix nerves_gate.package`. Devices use the real firmware SDK backend;
there is no fake hardware backend. SDK and platform libraries are never bundled.

Packages run trusted code in the device BEAM. Native dependencies must be built
for its architecture. Upgrades are cold restarts with a bounded health check.
App data lives on the commissioned SD card; handle unavailable storage explicitly.
